'''Flashpoint 1''' is the inaugural season of the new ''Counter-Strike'' organization-owned league headed up by [[Cloud9]] and [[Immortals|Immortals Gaming Club]]. The season features 8 permanent members as well as 4 qualified teams competing over a $1,000,000 {{Abbr/USD}} prize pool. The launch of the league also coincided with [[FunPlus Phoenix]] entering ''Counter-Strike''.

The season finals were to be held in the [[wikipedia:Ericsson Globe|Stockholm Ericsson Globe]] but were cancelled and moved to the FACEIT Studio in Los Angeles due to the increasing global spread of [[lpcommons:List of events affected during the 2019-20 coronavirus outbreak|COVID-19]]. Following the first week of matches, the remainder of the league was migrated entirely online as a further safety precaution.

