===Format===
* '''Phases 1 & 2:'''
** Three double-elimination (GSL) format groups
*** Each group has 4 teams
*** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}
** Points Awarded: 1st - 75pts, 2nd - 50pts, 3rd - 30th pts, 4th - 15pts
** Groups are determined live in [https://www.dropbox.com/s/sqe2vwrd8sm9l4o/Flashpoint%20Format%20Explainer.pdf GSL-style seeding show] on the day before<!--

--><br/><br/>
* '''Playoffs:'''
** Double-Elimination bracket
** Top 8 teams in the points ranking qualify
** Seeded using the points ranking
** All matches are {{Abbr/Bo3}}

